stateDiagram-v2
  [*] --> Idle
  Idle --> Waiting: append() / open(log.lock, "wx") EEXIST
  Waiting --> Waiting: pause 2 ms (stale lock > 10 s is removed)
  Waiting --> Unavailable: 5 s timeout -> AuditLogUnavailable
  Idle --> Locked: lock acquired
  Waiting --> Locked: lock acquired
  Locked --> Unavailable: lastHash() finds torn last line
  Locked --> Written: appendFileSync(rec, prevHash = tail)
  Written --> Idle: unlink lock
  Idle --> AnchorRead: anchor() / read() count+head
  AnchorRead --> Anchored: append {count, head} to .anchors
  Anchored --> Idle
